</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A1.SS3" title="In Appendix A Appendix ‣ Does Math Reasoning Improve General LLM Capabilities? Understanding Transferability of LLM Reasoning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">A.3 </span>PCA Analysis under Varying Settings</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A1.SS4" title="In Appendix A Appendix ‣ Does Math Reasoning Improve General LLM Capabilities? Understanding Transferability of LLM Reasoning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">A.4 </span>Token Distribution Shifts</span></a>
<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_subsection">
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsubsection"><a href="#A1.SS4.SSS1" title="In A.4 Token Distribution Shifts ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ Does Math Reasoning Improve General LLM Capabilities? Understanding Transferability of LLM Reasoning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">A.4.1 </span>Details about the case study</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
