</section>
</section>
<section id="A1.SS5" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.5 </span>Breakdown Evaluation Results</h3>

<div id="A1.SS5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">As discussed in the paper, we evaluated recent off-the-shelf models and our fine-tuned models across math reasoning, other reasoning and non-reasoning tasks. The detailed breakdown results are presented in Table <a href="#A1.T6" title="Table 6 ‣ A.5 Breakdown Evaluation Results ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ Does Math Reasoning Improve General LLM Capabilities? Understanding Transferability of LLM Reasoning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a>, <a href="#A1.T7" title="Table 7 ‣ A.5 Breakdown Evaluation Results ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ Does Math Reasoning Improve General LLM Capabilities? Understanding Transferability of LLM Reasoning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">7</span></a> and <a href="#A1.T8" title="Table 8 ‣ A.5 Breakdown Evaluation Results ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ Does Math Reasoning Improve General LLM Capabilities? Understanding Transferability of LLM Reasoning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">8</span></a>:</p>
</div>
